WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.734
And now to

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.769
the security measures being taken

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.270
surrounding Trump's court

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.372
appearance tomorrow in Miami.

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:05.939
CNN's Carlos

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:09.042
Suarez is live from Doral, Florida,

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.111
outside the Trump Doral Hotel.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:11.845
Carlos,

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:12.912
city officials

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:13.680
say they're working

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.915
with all levels of law enforcement.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.450
We have heard that

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.686
the proud boys at far right militia group

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.688
there are expected to be there.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.622
Are our police

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.790
preparing to handle

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.126
any potential violence

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:27.994
Well,

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.863
if you ask that question to Miami's

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.698
police chief, he would tell you yes.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.033
According to the chief

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.100
of police out here,

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.636
he says that they have enough resources

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:37.604
and officers

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.938
to deal with a crowd of up

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.573
to 50,000 people

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.307
that might show up

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.443
to the federal courthouse tomorrow.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.445
Now, when pressed for specifics,

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:46.846
the chief of police said

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:47.614
that is something

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:48.715
that his police department

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.717
is not going to get into.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.119
There is a growing concern at this hour

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.421
whether law enforcement

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:56.322
across South Florida is ready to deal

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.657
with the possible crowd

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.692
of supporters of the former president,

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.194
as well as protesters

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.228
who might show up

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.930
outside of the federal courthouse

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.466
in downtown Miami at this hour.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:07.901
There are few barricades

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.636
outside of this courthouse,

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:10.904
and it is still unclear

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.672
whether Miami police plan

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.507
to separate these supporters

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:15.642
of the former president

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.843
from the folks

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:17.610
that are going to be out there

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.446
protesting the former president.

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:20.880
Here now is the chief of police

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.082
at a news conference

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.049
earlier this afternoon

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:25.418
We bring

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:25.752
in enough

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:26.319
resources

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.120
to handle

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.522
a crowd anywhere from 5000 to 50,000.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.658
We don't expect it to. Right.

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.194
So we appreciate the public's help

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.528
Everybody going out there

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.629
expressing themselves

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.731
in a peaceful and civil manner

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.936
And so the chief of police

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.370
really pushed back

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.638
on some questioning there

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:46.439
about exactly

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.241
just where all of these resources

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.476
are at this hour,

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.643
when we might expect

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.645
to see them outside of this courthouse.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:53.646
The chief ended up saying,

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.014
look, a lot of these decisions

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:55.882
we're going to make

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.784
really will depend on exactly

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:00.019
how many people turn out tomorrow.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.055
Jake, there was

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.190
a crowd of about 100

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.058
Trump supporters

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:06.626
outside of the Doral property

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.428
out here earlier this afternoon.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.896
At one point this afternoon,

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:10.597
some of those folks

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.764
got out onto the street.

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.233
However, our police here

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.301
were able to get everyone back on

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:16.803
to the sidewalk Jake.

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:18.338
Have any

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.839
officials notice

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.875
noted any concerning signs

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.076
by extremist groups

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.880
online of possible threats

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:27.981
Well, it's

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:28.748
our understanding,

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.050
according to law enforcement sources,

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:33.086
that a group of FBI agents

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:35.822
have been tasked with going across,

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.690
going through social media posts

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.325
for any possible threats

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.527
to the federal courthouse

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.128
in downtown Miami.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:42.495
We're told

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:43.630
that they're also taking a look

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.597
at some communications

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.966
between members of the Proud Boys,

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.334
because they were talking

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.969
about traveling to South Florida

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.471
ahead of tomorrow.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:51.971
However,

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.506
just about every law enforcement official

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:54.040
that we've talked

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.808
to, including the chief of police

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.043
for the city of Miami,

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:58.011
said that right now

00:02:58.011 --> 00:03:00.513
there are no credible threats to Miami.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.281
All right.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.082
Carlos Flores in Doral, Florida,

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:03.750
thank you so much.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.184
Joining us now

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:04.584
to further

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:06.553
explain the security concerns

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:07.453
over Trump's

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:08.254
arraignment is Jeh

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.088
Johnson, former

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.190
secretary of homeland security

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.592
during the Obama administration.

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:14.294
Secretary Johnson, thanks for joining us.

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:14.761
So Miami

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.329
officials say they're prepared

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.163
for tomorrow,

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:18.631
but some of the officials,

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:19.299
former officials

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:21.467
that we've had here in studio watching

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:22.168
what's going on in

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:23.770
Miami seemed alarm,

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:26.206
noting that there's just yellow tape

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.775
in some areas, a few plastic barriers,

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.011
but nothing like what we saw in New York

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.813
given what happened at the U.S.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:34.347
Capitol.

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:35.348
On January six,

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:37.050
given the calls to violence

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.251
that we've heard

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:41.154
and the bellicose language from many,

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:42.121
many Trump supporters,

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.490
including members of Congress,

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.292
Do you think that's sufficient

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.494
or should they be barricading

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:49.996
and preparing for the worst

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:54.033
Well, the downside to

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:54.300
all of

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:54.934
this, Jake,

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.003
is there hasn't been a whole lot of time

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.072
to prepare for this.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.840
The indictment just came down

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.308
late last week.

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:03.876
Normally in a situation

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:05.311
like this, law enforcement

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.313
wants a lot of time to provide

00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:09.616
adequate security.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:11.751
I am quite sure that right

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:14.887
now, as we speak, elements of the U.S.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:15.455
government,

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:17.190
the Department of Homeland Security,

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.558
the US Marshals, Federal

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:19.525
Protective Service,

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:21.461
Secret Service, the FBI,

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:23.363
along with local law enforcement

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:24.831
in Miami-Dade,

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:27.200
are thinking this through our erecting,

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.902
erecting hopefully the appropriate

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:30.536
barriers.

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.972
They know that community best.

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.474
As you touched on it,

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:36.843
I'm sure they're actively monitoring

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:38.111
social media.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.546
But we do have to anticipate

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:42.215
a potentially large

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.050
crowd here, particularly

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.351
given some of the rhetoric

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:46.886
from some of our so-called

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:50.056
public officials over the last few days.

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:52.325
But I've been down to Miami

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.493
Dade to oversee

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:55.862
active shooter training exercises.

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.830
It's a complicated jurisdiction,

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.232
but there's a lot of resources

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:00.033
down there.

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:00.466
Well,

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:01.467
some of the rhetoric

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:04.737
we've heard from members of Congress

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:08.141
and also from the Proud Boys

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:10.476
and others are a rather alarming.

00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:12.078
Now, obviously,

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:13.980
people have a First Amendment right

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.048
to express themselves.

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:16.816
And the mayor of Miami, Francis Suarez,

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:17.183
stressed

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:17.884
the importance

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:20.553
of letting people use their free speech.

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:22.322
Is there a way,

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.057
do you think, to keep this from

00:05:24.057 --> 00:05:25.158
getting out of control

00:05:28.027 --> 00:05:29.195
Jake, that is

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.764
probably my principal concern right now.

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:33.666
Some of the rhetoric we've heard over

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:34.767
the last couple of days

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.469
has been over-the-top

00:05:36.469 --> 00:05:38.304
dangerously irresponsible

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:40.173
with some of these extremist

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:43.076
in public life seek to outdo each other.

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.844
That kind of rhetoric

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:47.347
makes unacceptable behavior acceptable

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:50.216
and frankly, violence inevitable.

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:52.018
And, you know,

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:53.653
I can understand the impulse

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:55.254
of some of our leaders,

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:56.723
some of our rational leaders

00:05:56.723 --> 00:05:59.158
to avoid engaging

00:05:59.158 --> 00:06:00.727
in responding to this kind of thing.

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:01.527
But I do think

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:04.530
there comes a responsibility, frankly,

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:07.700
by federal officials who lead federal

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.135
and the law enforcement

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:11.003
to really speak out against this

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:13.206
and call it out and say

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:14.607
to those who are engaging

00:06:14.607 --> 00:06:17.343
this kind of dangerous rhetoric

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.945
So if somebody gets hurt,

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:19.979
we are going to,

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:22.281
within the fullest extent of the law,

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:24.751
seek to hold you responsible.

00:06:24.751 --> 00:06:26.552
It is a federal crime

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.321
to threaten a federal official

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:30.022
in the conduct of their office.

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:31.524
It is a federal crime

00:06:31.524 --> 00:06:33.659
to incite an insurrection.

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:34.961
And so

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:36.229
we've got to look to

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:38.064
not just the proud boys

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.799
and those who were on the ground,

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:40.767
who might be on the ground

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:42.502
in Miami-Dade tomorrow,

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:43.403
but also those

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:45.538
who are frankly inciting and encouraging

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:47.273
this kind of violence.

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:49.575
When you look at the charges

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.577
against Donald Trump in the indictment,

00:06:52.445 --> 00:06:54.280
as somebody once charged

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.382
with the safety of the American people

00:06:56.382 --> 00:06:57.049
on both

00:06:57.049 --> 00:06:58.418
at the Department of Homeland Security,

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:00.253
but then also prior in your career,

00:07:00.253 --> 00:07:02.455
when you were an undersecretary

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:03.389
at the Pentagon,

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:06.793
how alarmed are you

00:07:06.793 --> 00:07:09.662
at the those classified documents

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:14.033
being stored in such a reckless way

00:07:14.967 --> 00:07:19.038
and being shown off to individuals

00:07:19.472 --> 00:07:21.874
that are just visiting Donald Trump?

00:07:24.043 --> 00:07:25.178
Well, in addition, Jake,

00:07:25.178 --> 00:07:27.246
I was also years and years ago

00:07:27.246 --> 00:07:29.415
a federal prosecutor hired by none

00:07:29.415 --> 00:07:31.684
other than Rudy Giuliani in Manhattan

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:34.921
It's surreal

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:38.958
to know that there are TSA level,

00:07:39.358 --> 00:07:40.493
highly classified,

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:43.162
compartmentalized documents

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.498
lounging around and in banker's

00:07:45.498 --> 00:07:47.867
boxes in storage bins

00:07:47.867 --> 00:07:50.670
at Mar a Lago that the former president,

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:54.474
it seems, showed off to various people.

00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:57.477
We handled classified information

00:07:57.477 --> 00:07:58.644
in Washington

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:01.647
in the most secure fashion in skips.

00:08:01.981 --> 00:08:04.317
We don't talk about it outside of skips.

00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:07.253
And for Donald Trump to undertake to do

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:10.022
this is alarming.

00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:12.458
I'm concerned about the fallout

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:13.392
from this.

00:08:13.392 --> 00:08:15.761
You know, an interesting challenge, Jake,

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.163
when this case goes to trial

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:19.499
and I'm certain it will will be.

00:08:19.532 --> 00:08:20.666
How do you share

00:08:21.701 --> 00:08:22.935
this information?

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:23.903
With 12

00:08:23.903 --> 00:08:24.437
jurors

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:26.239
who were randomly selected off the street

00:08:26.239 --> 00:08:28.007
so they appreciate

00:08:28.007 --> 00:08:29.375
the gravity of what

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:31.744
former President Trump has done.

00:08:31.744 --> 00:08:34.247
There's a procedure for doing this called

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.382
CPR, the Classified Information

00:08:36.382 --> 00:08:37.650
Procedures Act.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:40.653
But to try to show redacted, redacted

00:08:40.653 --> 00:08:42.855
versions of this stuff or substance

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:43.623
So I think it's going to

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:44.891
be a challenge in this case.

